abstract: >
  A Chinese voice cloning model based on GPT-SoVITS, trained on 192
  utterances (25.7 minutes) of the Wuthering Waves character Aemeath
  (爱弥斯). Achieves 50% loss reduction and 60% top-3 accuracy gain
  after 20 epochs of fine-tuning.
